{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36684","headline":"钱塘江潮 · 罗隐","name":"钱塘江潮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怒声汹汹势悠悠，罗刹江边地欲浮。\n漫道往来存大信，也知反覆向平流。\n任抛巨浸疑无底，猛过西陵只有头。\n至竟朝昏谁主掌，好骑赬鲤问阳侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36684.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36684","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}